cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Raman Map Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A desktop GUI for exploring and analysing Raman hyperspectral maps,
  with baseline correction, peak fitting, spectral unmixing (MCR-ALS,
  N-FINDR), clustering, and 3D confocal volume rendering.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Akalabya
    family-names: Bissoyi
    email: akalabya.bissoyi@manchester.ac.uk
version: 0.8.0
date-released: "2026-05-29"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Raman spectroscopy
  - hyperspectral imaging
  - MCR-ALS
  - spectral unmixing
  - chemometrics
